        "title": "Add cloud chat rollback types and client method",
        "summary": "The shared cloud history contract in common now supports rolling back a chat to a previous run. Two new types, CloudHistoryChatRollback and CloudHistoryChatRolledBack, model the request payload and the response, with the response mode distinguishing between cut, note, and unchanged agent memory states. The createCloudHistoryClient factory gains a rollbackChat method that issues a POST request to the chats/{chatId}/rollback endpoint, returning the updated chat and rollback mode. This extends the Postgres-backed cloud history API with a new chat state mutation alongside existing fork and update operations.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "maintainers",
        "evidence": "The diff in common/src/desktop-cloud/history.ts introduces the CloudHistoryChatRollback and CloudHistoryChatRolledBack types and adds the rollbackChat method to the client factory.",
